# Per-tool .gitignore for AutoDock Vina (tool/autodock-vina) — MANAGED BY Ramin & Elnaz (coordinators).
#
# Policy for this project: we COMMIT everything so coordinators can review all files.
# Keep this list MINIMAL. Only genuinely disposable, tool-specific scratch belongs here.
# Do NOT ignore prepared inputs, native outputs, logs, poses, or results — reviewers need those.
# Ask a coordinator before adding anything here.

# examples (uncomment only if this tool produces them AND they are truly disposable):
# *.tmp
# *.bak
# scratch/
# .cache/

# MD generated files
md/systems/*_complex.pdb
md/jobs/*_run/
md/**/*.trr
md/**/*.xtc
md/**/*.cpt
md/**/#*#
md/**/*.log
